    "introMarkdown": "# Find every insurance policy that may cover your child\n\n\nMost families have more insurance cover than they realise. It often comes from places nobody\ntells you about: group insurance (gruppförsäkring) through a job, a union you joined ten years\nago, the municipality where your child goes to school. None of them contact you when something\nhappens. You have to file a claim with each insurer yourself, one at a time.\n\nSix questions. Answer them in whatever order suits you. You don't need every answer tonight.\n\n**We never say that a policy applies.** We tell you where you may have cover and how to get it\nassessed. If your child is already sick or injured: file a claim with every policy you find, even\nif you think it won't apply. See [Deadlines](deadlines.md).\n\n---\n",
