    "closingMarkdown": "## Once you have your list\n\nFor every policy you've found, write down: the company, the product name or group agreement\n(gruppavtal) number, and roughly which year it started. Check what each one actually covers\nbefore you file a claim — it saves time and guesswork. More than one policy can pay out for the\nsame event, but not always in the same way.\n\nThen file a claim with each policy separately — they don't talk to each other.\n\nNext: [How a claim works](claim-process.md).\n\nIf you need help interpreting what you've found, Konsumenternas Försäkringsbyrå (the Swedish\nConsumers' Insurance Bureau) can give free, independent guidance by phone. They don't sell\nanything.\n",
